<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Descargar StreamTV+</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #060a14;
    --panel: #0e1526;
    --line: #1c2740;
    --text: #eef1f4;
    --muted: #8993a1;
    --signal: #f2a93c;
    --signal-dim: #5a4319;
    --blue: #2a9bf5;
  }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

  html, body {
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    font-family: -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    min-height: 100%;
  }

  body {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 48px 24px;
  }

  .card {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 460px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .logo {
    width: 96px;
    height: 96px;
    margin: 0 auto 24px;
    border-radius: 22px;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--line), 0 12px 32px rgba(42, 155, 245, 0.15);
  }

  .logo img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    display: block;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: 30px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  p.lead {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    max-width: 34ch;
    margin: 0 auto 36px;
  }

  .download-btn {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    background: var(--signal);
    color: #1a1204;
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: 20px 24px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    border: 3px solid var(--signal);
    transition: background 0.15s ease, transform 0.1s ease;
  }

  .download-btn:hover {
    background: #ffbd5c;
  }

  .download-btn:focus-visible,
  .download-btn:focus {
    outline: none;
    background: #ffbd5c;
    border-color: #fff1d6;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 5px rgba(242, 169, 60, 0.25);
  }

  .download-btn:active {
    transform: scale(0.98);
  }

  .meta {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-family: "SF Mono", Consolas, monospace;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    margin-top: 14px;
  }

  .steps {
    margin-top: 44px;
    text-align: left;
    background: var(--panel);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 24px 24px 24px 20px;
  }

  .steps ol {
    list-style: none;
    counter-reset: step;
  }

  .steps li {
    counter-increment: step;
    display: flex;
    gap: 14px;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .steps li + li { margin-top: 16px; }

  .steps li::before {
    content: counter(step);
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 26px;
    height: 26px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--signal-dim);
    color: #ffd699;
    font-family: "SF Mono", Consolas, monospace;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .steps li span { color: var(--muted); }
  .steps li strong { color: var(--text); font-weight: 600; }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .dot { animation: none; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="logo">
      <img src="icon.png" alt="StreamTV+">
    </div>

    <h1>Instala StreamTV+</h1>
    <p class="lead">Descarga el instalador y tenla lista en tu celular o TV en un par de minutos.</p>

    <!-- 1) PEGA AQUI TU LINK DIRECTO AL .apk, reemplazando el # -->
    <a class="download-btn" href="https://github.com/jesusop073-ship-it/streamtv-plus/releases/download/v1.0.0/app-release.apk" download>Descargar APK</a>
    <div class="meta">Version 1.0.0 &middot; Android</div>

    <div class="steps">
      <ol>
        <li><span>Toca</span> <strong>Descargar APK</strong> <span>y espera a que termine.</span></li>
        <li><span>Abre el archivo</span> <strong>descargado</strong> <span>desde tus notificaciones o tu carpeta de Descargas.</span></li>
        <li><span>Si aparece un aviso, toca</span> <strong>Permitir</strong> <span>para instalar apps fuera de la tienda.</span></li>
        <li><span>Toca</span> <strong>Instalar</strong> <span>y luego abre la app. Listo.</span></li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
